WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.450
[Conan] On my last night, I checked out

2
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:03.820
one of Haiti's top groups, music bands,

3
00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:06.610
Grammy-nominated Boukman Eksperyans.

4
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:09.589
And as you can imagine, I blended in seamlessly.

5
00:00:09.589 --> 00:00:12.756
(Haitian roots music)

6
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:23.950
It was the perfect end to an unforgettable trip.

7
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:25.990
During my brief visit, I was blown away

8
00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:28.450
by the warmth, generosity, independence,

9
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:31.370
passion and humor of the Haitian people.

10
00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.900
The rest of the world needs to catch up

11
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.990
to what the Haitian people already know,

12
00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:38.620
that they have all it takes to thrive as a nation.

13
00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:40.570
You are an extraordinary people,

14
00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.600
you're a beautiful people,

15
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.400
and I think great things are coming your way.

16
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.694
Viva Haiti!

17
00:00:47.694 --> 00:00:49.944
(cheering)

18
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.320
I'm at a book stall in Haiti

19
00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.360
and I just love the randomness of this book.

20
00:01:00.227 --> 00:01:01.350
I don't know why.

21
00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:04.210
This is my friend, Eric.

22
00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:05.470
He's been helping us out on this trip.

23
00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:06.640
He's been amazing.

24
00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.630
We also found out that he is the Haitian Rock.

25
00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:11.463
Give it to them.

26
00:01:13.793 --> 00:01:14.626
(laughing)

27
00:01:14.626 --> 00:01:16.730
I like him so much more than the Haitian Vin Diesel.

28
00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:18.110
You're great, you're fantastic.

29
00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:18.943
Oh thank you.
One more time.

30
00:01:18.943 --> 00:01:19.776
Yeah.

31
00:01:20.891 --> 00:01:22.710
(laughing)

32
00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:23.543
Hey check it out.

33
00:01:23.543 --> 00:01:24.840
Remember that tap-tap painting

34
00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.340
I showed you earlier today?

35
00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:28.350
Thony is the guy that made it.

36
00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.320
This is going on a tap-tap.

37
00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:31.600
Crazy, thank you.

38
00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:32.910
You're welcome.

39
00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:33.760
That looks sad.

40
00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:37.970
I'm here at Ecole Nouvelle Zorange.

41
00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:42.190
I'm gonna learn some Creole today.

42
00:01:43.091 --> 00:01:44.050
It should go well.

43
00:01:45.396 --> 00:01:47.646
(laughing)

44
00:01:49.459 --> 00:01:51.150
(children chattering loudly)

45
00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:54.415
I taught them all to misbehave.

46
00:01:54.415 --> 00:01:55.248
I taught them.

47
00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:56.787
I walked in to a very nice,

48
00:01:56.787 --> 00:01:58.510
very respectful class,

49
00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:00.140
and I taught them to misbehave.

50
00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.680
I'm sorry.

51
00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:08.150
I'm in Haiti and just now getting the news

52
00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:12.790
about the government shutdown in the United States.

53
00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:14.040
Thank god I'm in Haiti,

54
00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.520
where the government actually works.

